  \left( \sum_{i\notin I} a_i +\sum_{i\notin I'} b_i + \sum_{i\notin I''} c_i+
  \max\left( 0 \,,\, \sum_{i\in I} ia_i +\sum_{i\in I'} ib_i + \sum_{i\in I''} ic_i-1\right)\right).\label{eq:Geoalt}
  \end{equation}
